Package: org.ipega-steamlink.icadesteamlink
Name: ICadeSteamLink
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Use the iPega PG-9083 controller in Steam Link. Position 4 (iCade) = digital; position 1 (Android V3) = full analog sticks and triggers, read from HID inside the app.
Maintainer: ipega-steamlink contributors
Author: ipega-steamlink contributors
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
